Suiwen distribution repository licensing

The files in tools/ are Copyright (c) 2026 Suiwen contributors and are
licensed under the MIT License (see tools/LICENSE).

This repository is a distribution index, not an assertion that the complete
Suiwen application is open source. Application binaries, when published,
carry their own license and third-party notices in the release. No future
license change is promised for third-party code.

Third-party language packs keep their original licenses. They are downloaded
from their original upstream releases; this repository does not relicense them.
Model weights and training data are not included.
